{"type":"text","timestamp":1784789678139,"sessionID":"ses_0723fd6fdffe7CQbwLpS4Xas43","part":{"id":"prt_f8dc12154001VlBTnwC0s5XssL","messageID":"msg_f8dc10c1b001YDHSFf1MjRUpSL","sessionID":"ses_0723fd6fdffe7CQbwLpS4Xas43","type":"text","text":"Based on the data, **McLaren** scored the most points at the Monaco Grand Prix between 1980 and 2010.\n\n| Constructor | Nationality | Total Points |\n|---|---|---|\n| McLaren | British | 218.5 |\n\n**Evidence path:**\n- Recalled entities: `LOGICAL.Constructor` (PE: `constructors`), `LOGICAL.ConstructorRaceData` (PE: `constructorResults`), `LOGICAL.Race` (PE: `races`) — all in `formula_1` database\n- `constructorResults` joins to `races` on `raceId` and to `constructors` on `constructorId`\n- Filtered Monaco Grand Prix races with year BETWEEN 1980 AND 2010, summed points per constructor\n\nFinal Answer: McLaren scored the most points (218.5) at Monaco Grand Prix between 1980 and 2010. The team is British.\nEvidence SQL: SELECT c.constructorId, c.name, c.nationality, SUM(cr.points) AS total_points FROM constructorResults cr JOIN races r ON cr.raceId = r.raceId JOIN constructors c ON cr.constructorId = c.constructorId WHERE r.name = 'Monaco Grand Prix' AND r.year BETWEEN 1980 AND 2010 GROUP BY c.constructorId ORDER BY total_points DESC LIMIT 1","time":{"start":1784789672276,"end":1784789678126}}}
